        "topic_accepted_answer": false
      },
      {
        "id": 129686,
        "name": "lutherbellhendricksv",
        "username": "lutherbellhendricksv",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lutherbellhendricksv/{size}/2350_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-28T13:19:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You could try, whenever a character is incapacitated, both enemy teams get a point, and play to a higher point total. This might let one team get \"free points\" by sitting back out of the fray, but if one team starts pulling ahead this way, it becomes in the other two teams' best interests to gang up. And hey, then they both score points!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:04:40.156Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 12129,
        "topic_slug": "three-player-skirmish",
        "display_username": "lutherbellhendricksv",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>You could try, whenever a character is incapacitated, both enemy teams get a point, and play to a higher point total. This might let one team get &quot;free points&quot; by sitting back out of the fray, but if one team starts pulling ahead this way, it becomes in the other two teams&#39; best interests to gang up. And hey, then they both score points!</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
        "user_id": 4521,
        "hidden": false,
        "trust_level": 1,
        "deleted_at": null,
        "user_deleted": false,
        "edit_reason": null,
        "can_view_edit_history": true,
