        "raw": "<p>When we do 3 way fights we do it elimination style.</p><p>Instead of needing say 5 points, you have 4 recoveries.</p><p>Everytime a character stands up that team loses one of their tokens.</p><p>Run out of tokens and an incapped character leaves the board.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This balanced out well because a team that got down would quickly team up with someone else against the curent leader.</p><p>There was only one game where a team was out more than one round, because you don&#39;t want to finish off someone you can turn against a common enemy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also check out some of our forums variant skirmish ideas, I know Spiff has them on his site. &nbsp;Some of them work really well with 3 teams, esp. the point holding ones or king of the volcano.</p>",
